id: pm-beads-g2p8
title: Normalize shallower YAML heredoc delimiters
description: "Fix Greptile thread 3889951963: a valid YAML block may place the heredoc opener deeper than its delimiter, so normalization must accept a shallower common prefix without accepting extra indentation."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
