claim_principal: pi-agent
author: pi-agent
severity: high
repro_steps: "Indent cat <<EOF deeper than EOF in a YAML shell block, then assign NPM and publish through $NPM."
resolution: "Normalize a delimiter by the shallower common YAML indentation prefix, retaining shell-level indentation semantics."
expected_result: The delimiter closes the heredoc and later executable assignments remain visible.
actual_result: Heredoc suppression consumes all later lines and can hide an unattested publish.
